# Cargo.lock IS checked in. This workspace builds applications — the
# console, `mcpm-web`, `mcpm-mcp` — not a library, so the exact
# dependency set is part of the deliverable. It also carries a pin the
# manifests no longer can: the framework crates come from
# crates.idealyst.io under caret requirements, so without this file a
# fresh clone can resolve different 1.5.x code, including transitive
# crates (runtime-shared) that no manifest here names.
/.idealyst/
/dist/
.env
.env.local
.DS_Store
dev.toml
